WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:04.346
With your own hands, you'd persuade.

2
00:00:04.346 --> 00:00:06.780
You wouldn't take your neighbor's money.

3
00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:08.502
You wouldn't take their time.

4
00:00:09.402 --> 00:00:13.815
But through a vote, a law, or a leader, you're more comfortable with it.

5
00:00:14.715 --> 00:00:16.559
On the map, that's a gap.

6
00:00:16.559 --> 00:00:18.900
One standard for your own hands.

7
00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:21.880
Another when the hands are someone else's.

8
00:00:22.780 --> 00:00:24.389
The force is the same.

9
00:00:24.389 --> 00:00:26.278
Only the distance changed.

10
00:00:26.278 --> 00:00:31.805
If you paid someone to take from your neighbor, what they did would be on you.

11
00:00:31.805 --> 00:00:35.233
A politician is someone you chose to act for you.

12
00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:41.778
This is how people who would never coerce anyone end up backing it at scale.

13
00:00:41.778 --> 00:00:42.877
On every side.

14
00:00:42.877 --> 00:00:45.149
Each for their own good values.

15
00:00:46.049 --> 00:00:52.418
Coercion, theft, and violence always reduce happiness, harmony, and prosperity.

16
00:00:52.418 --> 00:00:53.055
Always.

17
00:00:53.055 --> 00:00:55.045
Whoever carries them out.

18
00:00:55.945 --> 00:00:58.211
So here is a test for every vote.

19
00:00:58.211 --> 00:01:00.610
Would you do it with your own hands?
